CREATE TABLE "Chain" ("id" INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,"slug" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"namespace" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'evm',"enabled" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT true,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE "Token" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"chainId" INTEGER NOT NULL,"address" TEXT NOT NULL,"creator" TEXT NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"symbol" TEXT NOT NULL,"decimals" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 18,"totalSupply" TEXT,"txHash" TEXT,"createdBlock" BIGINT,"indexFromBlock" BIGINT,"verified" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "Token_chainId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("chainId") REFERENCES "Chain"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "Transfer" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"chainId" INTEGER NOT NULL,"tokenId" TEXT NOT NULL,"txHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"logIndex" INTEGER NOT NULL,"blockNumber" BIGINT NOT NULL,"blockHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"fromAddress" TEXT NOT NULL,"toAddress" TEXT NOT NULL,"amount" TEXT NOT NULL,"timestamp" TIMESTAMP(3),CONSTRAINT "Transfer_chainId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("chainId") REFERENCES "Chain"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "Transfer_tokenId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("tokenId") REFERENCES "Token"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "Trade" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"chainId" INTEGER NOT NULL,"tokenId" TEXT NOT NULL,"txHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"logIndex" INTEGER NOT NULL,"blockNumber" BIGINT NOT NULL,"blockHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"trader" TEXT NOT NULL,"side" TEXT NOT NULL,"amountIn" TEXT NOT NULL,"amountOut" TEXT NOT NULL,"feeAmount" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',"timestamp" TIMESTAMP(3),CONSTRAINT "Trade_chainId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("chainId") REFERENCES "Chain"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "Trade_tokenId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("tokenId") REFERENCES "Token"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "IndexerCursor" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"chainId" INTEGER NOT NULL,"contractAddress" TEXT NOT NULL,"lastBlock" BIGINT NOT NULL,"lastBlockHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "IndexerCursor_chainId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("chainId") REFERENCES "Chain"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "IndexedEvent" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"chainId" INTEGER NOT NULL,"txHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"logIndex" INTEGER NOT NULL,"blockNumber" BIGINT NOT NULL,"blockHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"address" TEXT NOT NULL,"eventName" TEXT NOT NULL,"payload" JSONB NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "IndexedEvent_chainId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("chainId") REFERENCES "Chain"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "AdminAuditLog" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"actorId" TEXT NOT NULL,"action" TEXT NOT NULL,"resource" TEXT NOT NULL,"resourceId" TEXT,"metadata" JSONB,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Token_chainId_address_key" ON "Token"("chainId","address");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Transfer_chainId_txHash_logIndex_key" ON "Transfer"("chainId","txHash","logIndex");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Trade_chainId_txHash_logIndex_key" ON "Trade"("chainId","txHash","logIndex");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "IndexerCursor_chainId_contractAddress_key" ON "IndexerCursor"("chainId","contractAddress");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "IndexedEvent_chainId_txHash_logIndex_key" ON "IndexedEvent"("chainId","txHash","logIndex");
CREATE INDEX "Token_creator_idx" ON "Token"("creator"); CREATE INDEX "Token_chainId_createdAt_idx" ON "Token"("chainId","createdAt");
CREATE INDEX "Transfer_chainId_fromAddress_blockNumber_idx" ON "Transfer"("chainId","fromAddress","blockNumber"); CREATE INDEX "Transfer_chainId_toAddress_blockNumber_idx" ON "Transfer"("chainId","toAddress","blockNumber");
CREATE INDEX "Trade_chainId_trader_blockNumber_idx" ON "Trade"("chainId","trader","blockNumber"); CREATE INDEX "Trade_tokenId_blockNumber_idx" ON "Trade"("tokenId","blockNumber");
CREATE INDEX "IndexedEvent_chainId_blockNumber_idx" ON "IndexedEvent"("chainId","blockNumber"); CREATE INDEX "AdminAuditLog_actorId_createdAt_idx" ON "AdminAuditLog"("actorId","createdAt");
